#: ../../tools/plant_reactome_tools.rst:32 2335a7b5f604406382d1d3ce8c79f855
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a specific Plant Reactome"
" pathway by stable ID. Returns pathway name, species, sub-events "
"(reactions), compartments, GO annotations, and cross-references. Example:"
" 'R-OSA-1119312' returns the Photorespiration pathway in Oryza sativa."
