#: ../../tools/plant_reactome_tools.rst:92 7a5f054c391a41af9ca892028aaee636
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for plant biological pathways in Plant Reactome "
"(Gramene). Plant Reactome is a curated resource for plant metabolic and "
"regulatory pathways, covering model and crop species including rice "
"(Oryza sativa), Arabidopsis thaliana, maize, wheat, and 140+ plant "
"species. Returns pathways matching the query with their stable IDs and "
"species. Example: 'photosynthesis' finds photosynthesis-related pathways."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/plant_reactome_tools.rst:96 82f1c484d5bd495bb3d2101d53ca9023
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for plant pathways. Examples: "
"'photosynthesis', 'Calvin cycle', 'flavonoid biosynthesis', 'nitrogen "
"fixation', 'auxin signaling'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/plant_reactome_tools.rst:99 df91fee6730a4d8599c286d7af753438
msgid ""
"``species`` (string, null) (optional) Species name to filter results. "
"Examples: 'Oryza sativa', 'Arabidopsis thaliana', 'Zea mays'. Default: "
"all species."
msgstr ""

